'''Felldir the Old''', a [[Skyrim:Nord|Nord]] [[Skyrim:CombatWarrior1H|warrior]], is an ancient hero currently residing in the [[Skyrim:Hall of Valor|Hall of Valor]] in [[Skyrim:Sovngarde (place)|Sovngarde]]. He was one of the warriors, along with [[Skyrim:Gormlaith Golden-Hilt|Gormlaith Golden-Hilt]] and [[Skyrim:Hakon One-Eye|Hakon One-Eye]], who fought against [[Skyrim:Alduin|Alduin]], ultimately sending him forward through time using an [[Lore:Elder Scrolls|Elder Scroll]]. He was also the architect of their plan to do so.

He and his compatriots later assist you in the final battle against Alduin in Sovngarde. Upon returning to Tamriel, you can summon his spirit using the first two words of the [[Skyrim:Call of Valor|Call of Valor]] [[Skyrim:Dragon Shouts|shout]]. 

He wears [[Skyrim:Greybeard's Robes|Greybeard's robes]] with a pair of [[Skyrim:Greybeard's Boots|Greybeard's boots]] and is armed with an [[Skyrim:Ancient Nord Greatsword|ancient Nord greatsword]]. He knows the following shouts: [[Skyrim:Fire Breath|Fire Breath]], [[Skyrim:Ice Form|Ice Form]], [[Skyrim:Become Ethereal|Become Ethereal]], [[Skyrim:Dismay|Dismay]], [[Skyrim:Disarm|Disarm]],
[[Skyrim:Unrelenting Force|Unrelenting Force]], though when summoned with Call of Valor, he will only use Unrelenting Force and Frost Breath in combat. 


